<title>GREECE: TABLE - Greek central bank fixing rates, Aug 19.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Greek central bank fixing rates, Aug 19.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Aug 19	Aug 18   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  287.660     285.470     247.020    16.45 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  308.290     308.600     306.830     0.48 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.635     157.195     158.970    -1.47 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.494	46.662	47.182    -1.46 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  462.300     458.960     419.180    10.29 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.115     139.605     141.685    -1.81 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.059	16.079	16.185    -0.78 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  243.210     242.580     212.430    14.49 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.855	 1.860	1.8880    -1.75 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.544	 1.550	1.5810    -2.34 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.090     189.700     183.135     3.80 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
